From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lzyxczw-cyber <lzyxczw@163.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:17:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ios launcher: the settings screen and the in-game menu are
 translated, English keys in zh-Hans and zh-Hant

The iPhone app's own screens carried their English text as literals, and a player whose device is Chinese got an English settings screen and in-game menu over a Chinese game (Rhythm Heaven Groove on an iPhone 18 Pro, iOS 27). The two screens now keep those literals as keys and look them up in Sources/zh-Hans.lproj/Localizable.strings and Sources/zh-Hant.lproj/Localizable.strings, which dm/ios/project.yml declares as the app's localizations (CFBundleLocalizations, development region en); a key without a translation stays English, and the Mac app's settings window, which has no strings resources, is unchanged.

The settings' labels, notes and option names come from dm/launcher.json in English (dm/games/settings.tsv); the row draws them through the same lookup, so the file stays language-neutral and a front end that draws its own list still reads English. The same holds for the in-game menu's rows (GameMenu.swift) and the section headings.

Checked with the iPhone app built from this commit (build_ipa_from_nsp.py --platform ios, Xcode 27.2, Metal toolchain 27B47) and installed on an iPhone 18 Pro (iOS 27, device language Chinese): the settings screen and the in-game menu are Chinese (screenshots in the PR), a start with DM_LAUNCHER=0 still runs Rhythm Heaven Groove at 60 fps with 0 dropped frames over 900 frames and no [RED] line, and the game itself is untouched. dm/ios/tests/test_launcher_storage.py passes. dm/tools/tests/test_nsp_mac_app.py has one failure at this pin (test_shader_watch_counts_the_list: ShaderWatch.__init__ takes 2 positional arguments), which is there without this change. The Traditional Chinese file is a best-effort translation and wants a native review.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: The iPhone launcher and in-game menu are English-only; this fork carries zh-Hans and zh-Hant strings until upstream has a localization mechanism.
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#418

